messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 980 and 661?I think the correct answer is: 649780\n', "\n\nTo find the product of **980** and **661**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n980 \\times 661 &= 980 \\times (600 + 60 + 1) \\\\\n&= 980 \\times 600 + 980 \\times 60 + 980 \\times 1 \\\\\n&= 588,\\!000 + 58,\\!800 + 980 \\\\\n&= 588,\\!000 + 58,\\!800 \\\\\n&= 646,\\!800 \\\\\n&= 646,\\!800 + 980 \\\\\n&= 647,\\!780\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{647,\\!780}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
