final_output:  ["127,813.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **133** and **961**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n133 \\times 961 &= 133 \\times (900 + 60 + 1) \\\\\n&= (133 \\times 900) + (133 \\times 60) + (133 \\times 1) \\\\\n&= 119,\\!700 + 7,\\!980 + 133 \\\\\n&= 127,\\!813\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{127,\\!813}\n\\]", '']
