messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 260 and 305?I think the correct answer is: 79307\n', '\n\nTo find the product of **260** and **305**, follow these easy steps:\n\n### Step 1: Break Down the Numbers\nFirst, express each number as the sum of its place values.\n\n\\[\n260 = 200 + 60\n\\]\n\\[\n305 = 300 + 5\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Use the Distributive Property\nMultiply each part of the first number by each part of the second number:\n\n\\[\n260 \\times 305 = (200 + 60) \\times (300 + 5)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= 200 \\times 300 + 200 \\times 5 + 60 \\times 300 + 60 \\times 5\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Calculate Each Part\n\n1. **\\(200 \\times 300\\)**\n   \\[\n   200 \\times 300 = 60,\\!000\n   \\]\n\n2. **\\(200 \\times 5\\)**\n   \\[\n   200 \\times 5 = 1,\\!000\n   \\]\n\n3. **\\(60 \\times 300\\)**\n   \\[\n   60 \\times 300 = 18,\\!000\n   \\]\n\n4. **\\(60 \\times 5\\)**\n   \\[\n   60 \\times 5 = 300\n   \\]\n\n### Step 4: Add All the Results Together\n\n\\[\n60,\\!000 + 1,\\!000 + 18,\\!000 + 300 = 79,\\!300\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{79,\\!300}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
