messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 611 and 966?I think the correct answer is: 599226\n', "\n\nTo find the product of **611** and **966**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n611 \\times 966 &= 611 \\times (900 + 60 + 6) \\\\\n&= 611 \\times 900 + 611 \\times 60 + 611 \\times 6 \\\\\n&= 549,\\!900 + 36,\\!600 + 3,\\!666 \\\\\n&= 549,\\!900 + 36,\\!600 \\\\\n&\\quad + 3,\\!666 \\\\\n&= 591,\\!566\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{591,\\!566}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
