messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 376 and 966?I think the correct answer is: 363716\n', "\n\nTo find the product of **376** and **966**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n376 \\times 966 &= 376 \\times (900 + 60 + 6) \\\\\n&= (376 \\times 900) + (376 \\times 60) + (376 \\times 6) \\\\\n&= 338,\\!400 + 22,\\!560 + 2,\\!256 \\\\\n&= 338,\\!400 + 22,\\!560 \\\\\n&= 360,\\!960 \\\\\n&= 360,\\!960 + 2,\\!256 \\\\\n&= 363,\\!216 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{363,\\!216}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
