messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 347 and 262?I think the correct answer is: 96914\n', "\n\nTo find the product of **347** and **262**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}347 \\\\\n\\times\\phantom{0}262 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\phantom{0}347 \\times 2 = 694 \\\\\n\\phantom{0}347 \\times 60 = 20,\\!820 \\\\\n\\phantom{0}347 \\times 200 = 69,\\!400 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\phantom{0}90,\\!914 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 347 by 2:**\n   \\[\n   347 \\times 2 = 694\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Multiply 347 by 60 (which is 6 tens):**\n   \\[\n   347 \\times 60 = 20,\\!820\n   \\]\n   \n3. **Multiply 347 by 200 (which is 2 hundreds):**\n   \\[\n   347 \\times 200 = 69,\\!400\n   \\]\n   \n4. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \\[\n   694 + 20,\\!820 + 69,\\!400 = 90,\\!914\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{90,\\!914}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
