messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 911 and 467?I think the correct answer is: 425436\n', "\n\nTo find the product of **911** and **467**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n911 \\times 467 &= 911 \\times (400 + 60 + 7) \\\\\n&= 911 \\times 400 + 911 \\times 60 + 911 \\times 7 \\\\\n&= 364,\\!400 + 54,\\!660 + 6,\\!377 \\\\\n&= 364,\\!400 + 54,\\!660 \\\\\n&= 419,\\!060 \\\\\n&\\quad +\\ 6,\\!377 \\\\\n&= 425,\\!437\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{425,\\!437}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
