messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 464 and 365?I think the correct answer is: 169310\n', "\n\nTo find the product of **464** and **365**, we'll use the **distributive property** to simplify the multiplication.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n464 \\times 365 &= 464 \\times (300 + 60 + 5) \\\\\n&= (464 \\times 300) + (464 \\times 60) + (464 \\times 5)\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply **464** by **300**\n\n\\[\n464 \\times 300 = 139,\\!200\n\\]\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply **464** by **60**\n\n\\[\n464 \\times 60 = 27,\\!840\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Multiply **464** by **5**\n\n\\[\n464 \\times 5 = 2,\\!320\n\\]\n\n**Step 4:** Add all the partial products together**\n\n\\[\n139,\\!200 + 27,\\!840 + 2,\\!320 = 170,\\!360\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{170,\\!360}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
