messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 921 and 334?I think the correct answer is: 307814\n', "\n\nTo find the product of **921** and **334**, we'll use the standard multiplication method. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}921 \\\\\n\\times\\phantom{0}334 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply 921 by 4 (the units digit of 334).\n\n\\[\n921 \\times 4 = 3,\\!684\n\\]\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply 921 by 30 (the tens digit of 334, shifted one position to the left).\n\n\\[\n921 \\times 30 = 27,\\!630\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Multiply 921 by 300 (the hundreds digit of 334, shifted two positions to the left).\n\n\\[\n921 \\times 300 = 276,\\!300\n\\]\n\n**Step 4:** Add all the partial products together.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}3,\\!684 \\\\\n+27,\\!630 \\\\\n+276,\\!300 \\\\\n\\hline\n307,\\!614 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{307,\\!614}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is "]]
